{
  "title": "Yellow Spicy Jamaican Ginger Curry",
  "description": "A sour and snappy Jamaican dish featuring ground ginger, this curry is a romantic and flavorful option for a special occasion, made with shojin-friendly ingredients and a mantecare emulsification technique to bring all the flavors together.",
